{"seq":3,"slug":"cosmic-rays","title":"宇宙线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/cosmic-rays","wordCount":1447,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"宇宙线\">宇宙线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>宇宙线是来自外太空的高能带电粒子，主要是质子和原子核，少量电子，能量横跨从约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV 到惊人的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>20</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{20}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV 以上——比地面最强加速器高出七个数量级。它们是人类发现的第一类宇宙&quot;粒子信使&quot;（1912 年赫斯的气球实验），却也是最难溯源的：因为带电，它们在星际和星系际磁场中被反复偏转，到达地球时方向早已被打乱，无法直接指向源头。这与<a href=\"high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>和<a href=\"gravitational-waves\">引力波探测</a>的直线传播形成鲜明对比。</p>\n<p>宇宙线把本 hub 的多条线索收束在一起：它们由<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>的费米过程加速，候选源包括超新星遗迹、<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>喷流和<a href=\"../compact-objects/gamma-ray-bursts\">伽马射线暴</a>；它们与物质或光子作用又产生<a href=\"high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>和伽马射线，使中微子成为&quot;看见&quot;宇宙线源的间接窗口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[宇宙线源加速带电粒子] --&gt; B[星际/星系际磁场偏转]&#10;  B --&gt; C[方向被打乱&lt;br/&gt;难以溯源]&#10;  A --&gt; D[能谱横跨 10^9 至 10^20 eV]&#10;  D --&gt; E[膝区 约 10^15 eV&lt;br/&gt;银河系源上限]&#10;  D --&gt; F[踝区 约 10^18 eV&lt;br/&gt;河外源接入]&#10;  D --&gt; G[GZK 截断 约 5e19 eV&lt;br/&gt;与 CMB 作用损能]&#10;  A --&gt; H[次级粒子 中微子与伽马]&#10;  H --&gt; I[多信使间接溯源]\">flowchart TD\n  A[宇宙线源加速带电粒子] --&gt; B[星际/星系际磁场偏转]\n  B --&gt; C[方向被打乱&lt;br/&gt;难以溯源]\n  A --&gt; D[能谱横跨 10^9 至 10^20 eV]\n  D --&gt; E[膝区 约 10^15 eV&lt;br/&gt;银河系源上限]\n  D --&gt; F[踝区 约 10^18 eV&lt;br/&gt;河外源接入]\n  D --&gt; G[GZK 截断 约 5e19 eV&lt;br/&gt;与 CMB 作用损能]\n  A --&gt; H[次级粒子 中微子与伽马]\n  H --&gt; I[多信使间接溯源]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能段</th>\n<th>能量范围</th>\n<th>主流解释</th>\n<th>探测方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低能</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;10^{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV</td>\n<td>银河系超新星遗迹</td>\n<td>直接（卫星/气球）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>膝区</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10^{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV</td>\n<td>银河系加速上限</td>\n<td>地面簇射阵列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>踝区</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10^{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV</td>\n<td>河外源开始主导</td>\n<td>大型地面阵列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超高能 UHECR</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;10^{19}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">19</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV</td>\n<td>极端河外加速器</td>\n<td>巨型混合阵列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"能谱结构-膝-踝与截断\">能谱结构：膝、踝与截断</h2><p>宇宙线全天能谱是一条横跨三十多个数量级流量的近乎完美的幂律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(E)\\propto E^{-\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但仔细看有几处&quot;折点&quot;，每处都编码着物理。在约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times10^{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV 处谱变陡，称为&quot;膝&quot;，一般解释为银河系加速器（主要是超新星遗迹）能力的上限——由<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>中的希拉斯判据，超新星激波的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\times L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 大致只能把质子加速到这个量级。</p>\n<p>在约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV 处谱又变平，称为&quot;踝&quot;，标志银河系成分耗尽、河外源开始主导。最有趣的是最高能端：在约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\times10^{19}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">19</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV 处谱急剧压低，称为 GZK 截断。其物理是超高能质子与宇宙微波背景光子发生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p+\\gamma_{\\rm CMB}\\to\\Delta\\to p/n+\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">CMB</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 反应而损能：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\rm GZK}\\approx 5\\times10^{19}\\ {\\rm eV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">GZK</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">19</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">eV</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>GZK 过程不仅压低谱，还副产<a href=\"high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>（所谓宇宙背景中微子），为多信使搜寻提供了又一目标。GZK 还限定了超高能宇宙线源的距离不超过约 50–100 Mpc（&quot;GZK 视界&quot;），因为更远的粒子早已损能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探测原理与成分之谜\">探测原理与成分之谜</h2><p>低能宇宙线流量高，可由卫星/气球直接捕获并逐个分辨粒子种类。但超高能段流量极低（每平方公里每世纪才一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>20</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;10^{20}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV 粒子），只能靠它们打入大气产生的&quot;广延大气簇射&quot;间接探测：一个原初粒子激发出包含上百亿次级粒子的级联，覆盖地面数平方公里。</p>\n<p>两种互补技术测量簇射：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>测量量</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地面粒子阵列</td>\n<td>簇射在地面的粒子密度</td>\n<td>占空比 100%、定能量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气荧光望远镜</td>\n<td>簇射激发氮分子的荧光</td>\n<td>直接看纵向发展、测成分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成分（是质子还是重核）由簇射最大发展深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 推断：质子簇射穿得更深、起伏更大，重核则浅而稳。这里隐藏着当前最大的争议——南半球的皮埃尔·奥热（Pierre Auger）观测站数据倾向于最高能段成分逐渐变重，而北半球的 Telescope Array 数据更偏向质子主导。2026 年宾州州立大学一项研究甚至提出超高能宇宙线可能含有比铁更重的核，进一步搅动了这一图景。奥热站目前运行的 AugerPrime 升级（自 2022 年起）正是为了逐事件区分成分以仲裁此争议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超高能源与多信使溯源\">超高能源与多信使溯源</h2><p>超高能宇宙线（UHECR）的源至今未定论。由希拉斯判据，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\times L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 极大的天体能加速到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>20</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{20}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV：活动星系核喷流、<a href=\"../compact-objects/gamma-ray-bursts\">伽马射线暴</a>、星暴星系、星系团激波都是候选。因带电粒子被磁场偏转，传统的&quot;看方向找源&quot;几乎失效——除非在最高能段（偏转最小）做各向异性分析。</p>\n<p>2021 年 Telescope Array 探测到一个能量约 244 EeV 的极端事件，命名为&quot;天照（Amaterasu）粒子&quot;，是仅次于 1991 年 320 EeV&quot;Oh-My-God 粒子&quot;的历史第二高能宇宙线。耐人寻味的是，它的到达方向指向本地宇宙的&quot;空洞&quot;区，没有明显候选源，引发对其起源的热烈讨论；2025 年有研究提出它可能源自耀变体驱动的扩散过程。正因为带电信使难以溯源，最有希望的突破在于多信使联动：用同源的<a href=\"high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>（直线传播、可指向）和伽马射线，间接定位那些把质子加速到极限的<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>宇宙线是能量跨度最大的宇宙信使，但因带电被磁场偏转而难以直接溯源，与<a href=\"high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>、<a href=\"gravitational-waves\">引力波探测</a>互补。</li>\n<li>能谱的膝（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10^{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV，银河系上限）、踝（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10^{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV，河外接入）、GZK 截断（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim5\\times10^{19}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">19</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV）各编码不同物理，GZK 视界把超高能源限在约百 Mpc 内。</li>\n<li>超高能段靠广延大气簇射间接探测，地面阵列与荧光望远镜互补，成分由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 推断，奥热与 Telescope Array 的成分分歧仍待 AugerPrime 仲裁。</li>\n<li>候选源都需满足<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>的希拉斯判据，&quot;天照粒子&quot;等极端事件指向未知，凸显溯源之难。</li>\n<li>多信使联动用同源中微子和伽马间接定位<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>喷流等极端加速器，是宇宙线起源研究的前沿出路。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"宇宙线","id":"宇宙线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"能谱结构：膝、踝与截断","id":"能谱结构-膝-踝与截断"},{"level":2,"text":"探测原理与成分之谜","id":"探测原理与成分之谜"},{"level":2,"text":"超高能源与多信使溯源","id":"超高能源与多信使溯源"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高能中微子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/high-energy-neutrinos"},"next":{"title":"X 射线与伽马望远镜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/facilities-coordination/xray-gamma-telescopes"}}